## Your Preferences Stick

- You can switch to Dark Mode, as light mode is the default. 
- That choice is saved in a cookie, so next time you log in, it remembers.

## Print Summary

- End of week: You can click "Print Progress Summary.
- It will create a PDF of your progress, taska complited, and your bookings. You can save it or print it.

## Data Safety

- Everything you do uses Firebase REST API: GET, POST, PATCH, DELETE.
- Firebase rules make sure you can only read/write your own userId data. No public write access.

## Log out

- You can log out of your account, and it will take you back to the login page.
